<div class="wb-body wb-equipment-form wb-ability-form">
  <header class="wb-item-heading"><img class="wb-item-icon" src="{{record.img}}" alt=""><div><span class="wb-eyebrow">{{#if isForm}}Form{{else}}Ability{{/if}}</span>
    <input
      class="wb-name"
      type="text"
      name="name"
      value="{{item.name}}"
      aria-label="{{#if isForm}}Form{{else}}Ability{{/if}} name"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    >
  </div></header>
  <div class="wb-equipment-fields">
    {{#if isForm}}<div><span class="wb-eyebrow">Type</span><p class="wb-item-brief">Form</p></div>
    {{else}}<label>Type<select name="system.kind" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each kinds}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/if}}
    <label>Category<input
      type="text"
      name="system.category"
      value="{{system.category}}"
      placeholder="Spell, class feature…"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
  </div>
  <label>Description<textarea name="system.description" rows="4" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{system.description}}</textarea></label>
  {{#if isForm}}<details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="form-trigger"><summary>Trigger</summary><div class="wb-equipment-fields">
    <label>Activation<select name="system.trigger.mode" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each triggerModes}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    <label>Resource<select name="system.trigger.resourceId" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each triggerResources}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    <label>When Current is<select name="system.trigger.comparison" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each triggerComparisons}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    <label>Threshold (points)<input
      type="number"
      name="system.trigger.threshold"
      value="{{system.trigger.threshold}}"
      placeholder="Resource maximum (outside forms)"
      step="1"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label class="wb-trigger-ending">When it stops matching<select name="system.trigger.endMode" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each triggerEndModes}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
  </div><details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Trigger help</summary><p>Checks when the resource changes. Blank threshold uses the resource maximum outside forms. Entry costs apply; leave them blank for a free transformation. Enable Allow over maximum on the resource to gain beyond its cap. Multiple matching forms ask you to choose.</p></details></details>{{/if}}
  {{#if isForm}}<details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="form-loadout"><summary>Form loadout</summary>
    <button type="button" data-action="pickFormPortrait" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Choose form portrait</button>
    <label>Portrait path<input
      type="text"
      name="system.loadout.portrait"
      value="{{system.loadout.portrait}}"
      placeholder="Base portrait"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label data-tooltip="0 shows the top of the image, 100 the bottom. Blank inherits Base framing. You can also adjust with a preview on Character → Appearance.">Portrait vertical framing (0–100)<input
      type="number"
      name="system.loadout.portraitY"
      value="{{system.loadout.portraitY}}"
      placeholder="Base framing"
      min="0"
      max="100"
      step="1"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <button type="button" data-action="pickFormToken" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Choose form token art</button>
    <label>Token art path<input
      type="text"
      name="system.loadout.tokenImg"
      value="{{system.loadout.tokenImg}}"
      placeholder="Unchanged"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <div class="wb-equipment-fields">
      <label>Token width (squares)<input
        type="number"
        name="system.loadout.tokenWidth"
        value="{{system.loadout.tokenWidth}}"
        placeholder="Unchanged"
        min="0.01"
        step="any"
        data-allow-decimal
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label>Token height (squares)<input
        type="number"
        name="system.loadout.tokenHeight"
        value="{{system.loadout.tokenHeight}}"
        placeholder="Unchanged"
        min="0.01"
        step="any"
        data-allow-decimal
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label>Token art scale<input
        type="number"
        name="system.loadout.tokenScale"
        value="{{system.loadout.tokenScale}}"
        placeholder="Unchanged"
        min="0.01"
        step="any"
        data-allow-decimal
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label>Transformation (seconds)<input
        type="number"
        name="system.loadout.transitionSeconds"
        value="{{system.loadout.transitionSeconds}}"
        min="0"
        step="any"
        data-allow-decimal
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
    </div>
    {{#if hasActor}}
    <div class="wb-section-heading"><h3 class="wb-section-title">Equipment preset</h3><button
      type="button"
      data-action="copyFormEquipment"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    >Copy current gear</button></div>
    <label class="wb-equipment-check"><input
      type="checkbox"
      name="system.loadout.gearEnabled"
      {{#if system.loadout.gearEnabled}}checked{{/if}}
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    > Use saved equipment</label>
    <div class="wb-form-loadout-list">{{#each formLoadout.equipment}}<label><input
      type="checkbox"
      name="system.loadout.equipment.{{id}}"
      {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}
      {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    > {{name}}</label>{{else}}<span class="wb-empty">No equippable items.</span>{{/each}}</div>
    <details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="form-abilities"><summary>Abilities shown</summary><div class="wb-form-loadout-list">{{#each formLoadout.abilities}}<label><input
      type="checkbox"
      name="system.loadout.abilities.{{id}}"
      {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}
      {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    > {{name}}</label>{{else}}<span class="wb-empty">No other abilities.</span>{{/each}}</div></details>
    <details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="form-resources"><summary>Resources shown</summary><div class="wb-form-loadout-list">{{#each formLoadout.resources}}<label><input
      type="checkbox"
      name="system.loadout.resources.{{id}}"
      {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}
      {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    > {{name}}</label><label>Maximum in this form · {{name}}<input
      type="number"
      min="0"
      step="1"
      name="system.loadout.resourceMaxima.{{id}}"
      value="{{maximum}}"
      placeholder="∞ · normal maximum"
      {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>{{/each}}</div></details>
    {{else}}<p class="wb-item-brief">Configure equipment, abilities and resources on a character's copy.</p>{{/if}}
    <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Loadout help</summary><p>Base portrait and gear return on End. Copy current gear or select a preset; an enabled empty preset stows all equipment. Changes made to equipped gear in a saved form are remembered when leaving it. Shared inventory, shots, uses and resource expenditure are preserved. Hand conflicts follow the existing equipment rules.</p><p>Token width and height are grid squares: enter 2 in both for 2×2. An unlinked token is a separate character copy: double-click that map token and Use the form from its own sheet. Using a sidebar character changes its prototype and linked map tokens. Blank token settings leave those aspects unchanged.</p><p>Abilities/resources shown are presentation choices. Show all reveals them for editing. Active abilities stay visible to End; hiding a record does not end its bonuses, stop recovery or block costs. Forms always remain available. For stat changes, use Bonuses.</p></details>
  </details>{{/if}}
  <fieldset class="wb-ability-fieldset"><legend>Costs</legend><div class="wb-equipment-fields">
    <label>Base AP<input
      type="number"
      name="system.apCost"
      value="{{system.apCost}}"
      placeholder="Not tracked"
      min="0"
      step="1"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label>AP discount stat<select name="system.apDiscountStat" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each stats}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    <label>Resource<select name="system.resourceId" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each resources}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    <label>Resource cost<input
      type="number"
      name="system.resourceCost"
      value="{{system.resourceCost}}"
      placeholder="Not tracked"
      min="0"
      step="1"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label>Cost unit<select name="system.resourceUnit" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each units}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
  </div><p class="wb-item-brief">{{#if record.apAdjusted}}Current cost: {{record.ap}} AP{{else}}{{#unless hasActor}}AP discounts preview on a character.{{/unless}}{{/if}}</p></fieldset>
  {{#unless passive}}<details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="ability-restoration"><summary>Restoration</summary><div class="wb-equipment-fields">
    <label>Restore<select name="system.restoration.target" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each restorationResources}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    <label>Amount or dice<input
      type="text"
      name="system.restoration.amount"
      value="{{system.restoration.amount}}"
      placeholder="20 or 2d6+2; blank for none"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label>Unit<select name="system.restoration.unit" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each restorationUnits}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
  </div><p class="wb-item-brief">Applied once on Use. Uses the resource's overflow setting; percentage amounts use its maximum. A pure restoration ability spends nothing if the pool is already full.</p></details>{{/unless}}
  {{#unless passive}}{{#unless isForm}}<details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="ability-targeting"{{#if targeting.enabled}} open{{/if}}><summary>Targeting</summary><div class="wb-equipment-fields">
    <label>Target<select name="system.targeting.mode" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each targeting.modes}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    {{#if targeting.enabled}}<label>Uses stat<select name="system.targeting.stat" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each targeting.stats}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    {{#if targeting.save}}<label>Target saves with<select name="system.targeting.saveStat" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each targeting.saveStats}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    <label>Save DC<input
      type="number"
      name="system.targeting.dc"
      value="{{system.targeting.dc}}"
      placeholder="{{targeting.dcDefault}}"
      step="1"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label>On a successful save<select name="system.targeting.onSave" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each targeting.onSave}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/if}}
    <label>Damage<input
      type="text"
      name="system.targeting.damage"
      value="{{system.targeting.damage}}"
      placeholder="2d8 + @mod; blank for none"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label>Damage type<input
      type="text"
      name="system.targeting.damageType"
      value="{{system.targeting.damageType}}"
      placeholder="Fire, Lightning, Slashing…"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>{{/if}}
  </div><p class="wb-item-brief">{{#if targeting.enabled}}Alt-click a token with your character selected to use this on it. @mod is the chosen stat's modifier.{{#if targeting.save}}{{#if targeting.dcPreview}} Current DC: {{targeting.dcPreview}}.{{/if}} A blank DC uses 12 + the stat's modifier.{{else}} The attack rolls d20 + modifier against Natural Evasion; a natural 20 is a critical hit.{{/if}}{{else}}Choose an attack roll or a save to use this ability on a target.{{/if}}</p></details>{{/unless}}{{/unless}}
  <section class="wb-item-bonuses" aria-label="Item bonuses">
    <div class="wb-section-heading"><h2 class="wb-section-title">Bonuses</h2><button
      type="button"
      data-action="itemEffect"
      data-operation="create"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    >Add bonus</button></div>
    {{#each itemEffects}}
    <div class="wb-item-bonus-row" data-item-effect-id="{{id}}">
      <button type="button" class="wb-bonus-name" data-action="itemEffect" data-operation="edit"><strong>{{name}}</strong><span>{{summary}}</span></button>
      <span class="wb-item-brief">{{state}}</span>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-action="itemEffect"
        data-operation="toggle"
        aria-label="Toggle {{name}}"
        {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ><i
        class="fa-solid fa-power-off"
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></i></button>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-action="itemEffect"
        data-operation="delete"
        aria-label="Remove {{name}}"
        {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ><i
        class="fa-solid fa-trash-can"
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></i></button>
    </div>
    {{else}}<p class="wb-empty">No bonuses. Add one, choose a stat and enter an amount.</p>{{/each}}
  </section>
  {{#if passive}}<p class="wb-item-brief">Passive bonuses apply while this ability is on your character.</p>{{else}}<label
    class="wb-equipment-check"
    data-tooltip="Manual correction; Use on the character pays costs"
  ><input
    type="checkbox"
    name="system.effectsActive"
    {{#if system.effectsActive}}checked{{/if}}
    {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
  > Bonuses active (manual correction)</label>{{/if}}
  {{#unless passive}}<details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="ability-duration"><summary>Active duration</summary><div class="wb-equipment-fields">
    <label>Duration<input
      type="number"
      name="system.activeDuration.value"
      value="{{system.activeDuration.value}}"
      min="0"
      step="1"
      placeholder="Until ended"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label>Unit<select name="system.activeDuration.units" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each durationUnits}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
<label>Rounds in combat (optional)<input
    type="number" name="system.activeDuration.combatRounds" value="{{system.activeDuration.combatRounds}}"
    min="0" step="1" placeholder="Use duration above" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
  ></label>  </div><p class="wb-item-brief">Starts on Use; expires bonuses or the form. Blank/0 keeps manual End. Optional combat rounds replace the duration when used in a started encounter. Rounds need a started encounter; minutes/hours follow Foundry game time. Instant restoration stays applied.</p></details>{{/unless}}
  <details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="ability-trackers"><summary>Uses &amp; cooldown</summary><div class="wb-equipment-fields">
    <label>Maximum uses<input
      type="number"
      name="system.uses.max"
      value="{{system.uses.max}}"
      placeholder="Unlimited"
      min="0"
      step="1"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    {{#if record.uses.tracked}}<label>Uses left<input
      type="number"
      name="usesCurrent"
      value="{{record.uses.value}}"
      step="1"
      data-tooltip="Clear to restore to maximum"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>{{/if}}
    <label>Uses reset<select name="system.uses.resetOn" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each useRecoveryChoices}}<option
      value="{{value}}"
      {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}
    >{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
    <label>Recovery notes<input
      type="text"
      name="system.uses.recovery"
      value="{{system.uses.recovery}}"
      placeholder="Special recovery conditions…"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label>Cooldown (rounds)<input
      type="number"
      name="system.cooldown.rounds"
      value="{{system.cooldown.rounds}}"
      placeholder="None"
      min="0"
      step="1"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    <label>Cooldown remaining<input
      type="number"
      name="system.cooldown.remaining"
      value="{{system.cooldown.remaining}}"
      min="0"
      step="1"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
    {{#unless passive}}<label class="wb-equipment-check"><input
      type="checkbox"
      name="system.cooldown.automatic"
      {{#if system.cooldown.automatic}}checked{{/if}}
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    > Count cooldown automatically</label>{{/unless}}
    <label>Duration notes<input
      type="text"
      name="system.duration"
      value="{{system.duration}}"
      placeholder="Special ending conditions…"
      {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
    ></label>
  </div></details>
  <details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="ability-notes"><summary>Notes &amp; image</summary>
    <label>Notes<textarea name="system.notes" rows="3" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{system.notes}}</textarea></label>
    <label>Image path<input type="text" name="img" value="{{item.img}}" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}></label>
  </details>
  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help" data-sync="ability-help"><summary>Ability help</summary>
    <p>Use pays recorded resource costs and one tracked use. In combat it also pays AP and spends a reaction for Reaction abilities. Use applies restoration, starts the cooldown and enables bonuses. End disables bonuses without undoing restoration, refunding costs or clearing cooldown. Passive bonuses apply while owned. Forms replace the previous form; Base form ends it for free. Optional Active duration expires bonuses/forms; automatic cooldown counts rounds to your turn. Both start on the next Use, and round clocks require a started encounter. Manual active/cooldown corrections detach their current clock; later Uses start configured clocks again. Duration notes are descriptive. Clear Maximum uses for unlimited uses; clear Uses left to restore its maximum.</p>
    <p>Uses reset is opt-in. New combat and Own turn also reset on long rest; Own turn resets at combat start too. Manual never resets automatically. Recovery notes are descriptive. Recovery refills uses without ending bonuses or clearing cooldowns. No attack or damage roll is created here.</p>
    <p>AP discounts use the selected current stat modifier, capped at half the base cost rounded down in either direction. Spells normally start at 11 AP before the INT/FTH discount. Resource costs can be points or a percentage of the resource maximum. Deleted custom resources remain marked Missing resource until you choose another.</p>
  </details>
</div>
